OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FScattered showers along the
OL,6,Fcoast initially, gradually extending
OL,7,Facross many other eastern areas this
OL,8,Fmorning and afternoon, then mostly
OL,9,Fdying away later. Further west staying
OL,10,Fdry, with cloud increasing after a
OL,11,Fsunny start. Temperatures near normal.
OL,12,FBreezy along the coast.
OL,13,
OL,14,CTonight:FMainly dry at first with long
OL,15,Fclear periods. Later in the night
OL,16,Fscattered showers arrive along the
OL,17,Fcoast, perhaps pushing showers a
OL,18,Flittle way inland. Remaining breezy
OL,19,Falong the coast.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
