OL,2,W+.-'"-$/*%*%*%/"-$/*%Q,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CSunday:FLargely dry initially with
OL,6,Fsunny spells, but scattered coastal
OL,7,Fshowers. Through the day showers
OL,8,Fextend further west and cloudier
OL,9,Fconditions develop, although
OL,10,FDerbyshire likely remains dry. Coastal
OL,11,Fareas become windy.
OL,12,
OL,13,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FOften
OL,14,Fcloudy with a chance of patchy rain
OL,15,FMonday and Tuesday, but also some
OL,16,Fdrier periods. Potentially spells of
OL,17,Fheavy rain for Wednesday. Temperatures
OL,18,Fwill be generally near normal.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
